#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:5 f78372ed862c461484bc5cbe25d572fd
msgid "SLCAN Access on F7/H7 Based Autopilots"
msgstr "F7/H7 飞控的 SLCAN 访问"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:7 eeeafef5ac2741eda33016db85f18fb5
msgid ""
"Enabling SLCAN allows the autopilot to connect to CANBUS through USB on PC. "
"It allows viewing, configuration and software updates of devices connected "
"to the CANBUS. There are two different applications for using SLCAN to "
"modify DroneCAN device parameters: DroneCAN GUI or Mission Planner. But "
"first, the SLCAN interface must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"启用 SLCAN 允许飞控通过 PC 上的 USB 连接到 CANBUS。它允许查看、配置和更新连接到 CANBUS "
"的设备的软件。有两种不同的应用程序可通过 SLCAN 修改 DroneCAN 设备参数：DroneCAN GUI 或 Mission "
"Planner。但首先，必须启用 SLCAN 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:11 3ec66345463d49ed9b2af63c4de26d1b
msgid ""
"SLCAN access via COM port is disabled when armed to lower cpu load. Use "
"SLCAN via MAVLink instead. The MAVLink method is generally preferred in any "
"case."
msgstr ""
"解锁时通过 COM 端口的 SLCAN 访问被禁用，以降低 CPU 负载。请改用通过 MAVLink 的 SLCAN。任何情况下通常首选 MAVLink"
" 方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:14 cf32bdfd34234d4f812a0434b4ac3219
msgid "SLCAN Interface"
msgstr "SLCAN 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:16 c54109fc718f4f848977bee4e8ebd364
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot firmware provides two software USB interfaces, accessed "
"simultaneously from the single physical USB connector. In  Mission Planner, "
"you will see two COM ports assigned to the autopilot (if not, see "
"Troubleshooting section below). One is for the SLCAN interface, the other "
"for the normal MAVLink based Ground Control Station (GCS) connection."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 固件提供两个软件 USB 接口，通过单个物理 USB 连接器同时访问。在 Mission Planner "
"中，您将看到分配给飞控的两个 COM 端口（如果没有，请参阅下方的故障排除部分）。一个用于 SLCAN 接口，另一个用于正常的基于 MAVLink "
"的地面控制站（GCS）连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:18 ecd3cef1419b45a387804e9061e61d82
msgid ""
"in firmware 4.5 and later, most autopilots that present two COM ports will "
"both be for normal MAVLink connections and not have one default to SLCAN "
"since SLCAN over MAVLink is the preferred connection method now."
msgstr ""
"在固件 4.5 及更高版本中，大多数呈现两个 COM 端口的飞控将两者都用于正常 MAVLink 连接，而不会默认将其中一个设为 SLCAN，因为通过 "
"MAVLink 的 SLCAN 现在是首选连接方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:20 0c9ff0f97e3f4a4e8a25f4e978794cf0
msgid ""
"In firmware 4.0 and earlier, they will be indistinguishable in the Mission "
"Planner COM port selection box until you try to connect to the GCS with the "
"SLCAN port that has been enabled for SLCAN protocol. (In later firmware "
"versions, together with using the latest `Mission Planner driver set "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/driver.msi>`__ , each "
"port will be clearly labeled.)"
msgstr ""
"在固件 4.0 及更早版本中，在 Mission Planner COM 端口选择框中，两者看起来相同，直到您尝试用已为 SLCAN 协议启用的 "
"SLCAN 端口连接地面站。（在较新的固件版本中，配合使用最新的 `Mission Planner 驱动程序集 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/driver.msi>`__，每个端口都会有清晰的标签。）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:22 60df14b1633c4b119bf3bf6224789bdf
msgid ""
"The port that will not connect (if already configured for SLCAN protocol, "
"however, default is usually for MAVLink protocol so it can connect normally)"
" is the SLCAN interface. This COM port is associated with a SERIALx port in "
"the autopilot parameters. This SERIALx port will be the highest numbered "
"port in the parameter list."
msgstr ""
"无法连接的端口（如果已配置为 SLCAN 协议，但默认通常为 MAVLink 协议，因此可以正常连接）是 SLCAN 接口。此 COM "
"端口在飞控参数中与某个 SERIALx 端口关联，通常是参数列表中编号最高的端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:24 68796b8f9f27499a9623f8276730778f
msgid ""
"If both COM ports connect to Mission Planner, then the SLCAN protocol has "
"not been set on that port and must be changed to use SLCAN."
msgstr "如果两个 COM 端口都能连接到 Mission Planner，则该端口尚未设置 SLCAN 协议，必须更改为使用 SLCAN。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:27 641a0cc1f74e49b8816247d85baf56b4
msgid "Configuring SLCAN SERIALx PORT"
msgstr "配置 SLCAN SERIALx 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:29 533c13f254104a8eb8614fa338b1ea75
msgid ""
"Set CAN_SLCAN_CPORT = 1, if not already set or = 2 if you want to examine "
"devices on a second CAN bus, if the autopilot provides it."
msgstr "将 CAN_SLCAN_CPORT 设为1（如果尚未设置），或设为2（如果您希望检查第二个 CAN 总线上的设备，前提是飞控提供该总线）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:31 88e039091f7c439f9ca0367594b1bdf6
msgid ""
"Connect to Mission Planner. In the Full Parameters list set the highest "
"numbered ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` to 22 and reboot. Now only the non SLCAN USB "
"COM port will connect to Mission Planner and the SLCAN port will be ready "
"for use."
msgstr ""
"连接到 Mission Planner。在完整参数列表中，将编号最高的 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 设为22并重启。现在只有非 SLCAN"
" 的 USB COM 端口会连接到 Mission Planner，SLCAN 端口将准备就绪可供使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:35 4ad290f5d3204c799c778c61c6e7b50b
msgid "Making Changes to DroneCAN Devices"
msgstr "修改 DroneCAN 设备"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:37 8528da3936944ce5b67f6cba17ccd44f
msgid ""
"Once SLCAN has been enabled, you can use :ref:`Mission Planner "
"<planner:dronecan-uavcan-slcan>`  to make changes immediately to device "
"parameters or firmware update."
msgstr ""
"启用 SLCAN 后，您可以使用 :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:dronecan-uavcan-slcan>` "
"立即对设备参数进行更改或固件更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:39 ee948f7222a04d0ba0127488c291db82
msgid ":ref:`DroneCAN GUI tool <common-uavcan-gui>` can also be used"
msgstr ":ref:`DroneCAN GUI 工具 <common-uavcan-gui>` 也可以使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:41 a09cef7511c941978dc0920e4c1a9f9d
msgid ""
"here is an example video of configuring a DroneCAN power monitor device:"
msgstr "以下是配置 DroneCAN 电源监控设备的示例视频："

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:47 57478d849e9449c396820341c85340b0
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:49 8eb96f12a2254a4f8f151eb482565014
msgid ""
"Occasionally, Windows will only present one COM port in Mission Planner. In "
"that case, you may still be able to connect to Mission Planner and change "
"the parameters, if the COM port Windows has chosen to display is the "
"autopilot port with MAVLink protocol selected.  However, you will most "
"likely need to load the composite USB driver in order to obtain both COM "
"ports, as shown in :ref:`these instructions<loading-composite-USB>`, once "
"the SLCAN port protocol has been enabled."
msgstr ""
"有时 Windows 在 Mission Planner 中只显示一个 COM 端口。在这种情况下，如果 Windows 选择显示的 COM "
"端口是选择了 MAVLink 协议的飞控端口，您仍可能连接到 Mission Planner 并更改参数。但是，一旦 SLCAN "
"端口协议被启用，您很可能需要按照 :ref:`这些说明 <loading-composite-USB>` 加载复合 USB 驱动程序才能获得两个 COM"
" 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:51 df3594d85f514c259a1afefd2472b577
msgid ""
"If you reboot the autopilot, the composite Windows USB driver may be "
"unloaded and the process repeated upon re-attachment."
msgstr "如果您重启飞控，Windows 复合 USB 驱动程序可能会被卸载，重新连接时需要重复该过程。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-slcan-f7h7.rst:53 83c4157aa5854eb4975a2d5cfac5553e
msgid ""
"If the SLCAN port has been configured, and if only one USB COM port appears,"
" it may not be the normal MAVLink protocol port (usually SERIAL0) and you "
"will not be able to connect Mission Planner. You can either re-enable the "
"Composite Driver each time you attach, as above, or simply revert the SLCAN "
"port to MAVLink protocol once attached with the Composite driver and "
"subsequently use the single COM port Windows presents when connecting to "
"Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"如果 SLCAN 端口已配置，且只有一个 USB COM 端口出现，它可能不是正常的 MAVLink 协议端口（通常为 SERIAL0），您将无法连接 "
"Mission Planner。您可以在每次连接时重新启用复合驱动程序（如上所述），或者在使用复合驱动程序连接后将 SLCAN 端口还原为 "
"MAVLink 协议，之后连接 Mission Planner 时使用 Windows 呈现的单个 COM 端口。"
